4. Task 4: Rotate String – LeetCode
A string goal is a rotation of s if it occurs inside:
s + s
Java Solution
class Solution {

    public boolean rotateString(String s, String goal) {

        if (s.length() != goal.length()) {
            return false;
        }

        return (s + s).contains(goal);
    }
}
Example
Input:
s = "abcde"
goal = "cdeab"

Output:
true
Because:
s + s = "abcdeabcde"
and:
"cdeab"
is present.
Time: O(n²) worst case depending on substring implementation.
