6. Task 6: Find All Anagrams in a String – LeetCode
Use a sliding window + frequency array.
Java Solution
import java.util.*;

class Solution {

    public List<Integer> findAnagrams(
            String s, String p) {

        List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();

        if (p.length() > s.length()) {
            return result;
        }

        int[] pCount = new int[26];
        int[] window = new int[26];

        for (char c : p.toCharArray()) {
            pCount[c - 'a']++;
        }

        int k = p.length();

        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {

            window[s.charAt(i) - 'a']++;

            if (i >= k) {
                window[s.charAt(i - k) - 'a']--;
            }

            if (i >= k - 1 &&
                Arrays.equals(pCount, window)) {

                result.add(i - k + 1);
            }
        }

        return result;
    }
}
Example
Input:
s = "cbaebabacd"
p = "abc"

Output:
[0, 6]
Anagrams occur at:
"cba" → index 0
"bac" → index 6
Time: O(26n) ≈ O(n)
Space: O(26)
